TRAVEL

People who take a vacation to get a tan usually go pale when they get
the bill.

It's one of life's contradictions that travel broadens one, but so does
sitting at home on the sofa.

Unfortunately, many people hate taking a cruise, because it makes them
cross.

A trip is what teaches you first-hand about the high cost of leaving.

A travel agency went out of business shortly after taking out an ad that
read, "Please go away!"

Nancy M. Carson <nancy.carson@juno.com>
