SHARP SHOOTER

A co-worker who had returned from a company trip to Singapore and
Indonesia was waxing eloquent about his many adventures.  After he
finally finished and was out of earshot, another employee came over to
me.  "Don't mind him," she said.  "He's just suffering from jet brag!"

Don Arey in Reader's Digest
